  "namedChanges": [
    "in `records.ts` the imports `./config`, `./token`, `./bearer`, `./dpop` and `./recordTypes` are replaced by imports of `vault-origin-rule`, `lws-session-bridge` and `record-types`; the names the taken code does not use are dropped from the import lists",
    "in `vaultContext.ts` the imports `./config` and `./recordTypes` are replaced by `vault-origin-rule` and `record-types`",
    "the dynamic import `await import(\"./dpop\")` (line 448) is `await import(\"@kaigilb/gilbplatformcode-lws-session-bridge\")`",
    "`authHeader` (lines 245-246) takes an optional `method` and passes it to `bearerHeaderFor`, and `patchRecord` (line 984) calls `authHeader(reqUrl, \"PATCH\")`",
    "comments that name a host are reworded, and `BASE_ORIGIN` in a comment reads `baseOrigin()`; no code changed",
    "in `records.ts` (0.3.0) the import from `record-types` gains `typeUriForVaultNamespace` (used by `retypeRecord`); `retypeRecord` (line 922) calls `authHeader(reqUrl, \"PUT\")` and `deleteRecord` (line 1017) calls `authHeader(reqUrl, \"DELETE\")`, so the credential is bound to the method (`authHeader` already takes the method, 0.1.0)",
    "in `records.ts` (0.4.0) `idFromResourceUrl` (line 257), `throwForCreateStatus` (line 241) and `toWireFacts` (line 360) are `export`ed; they were private. No token of their bodies changed, and nothing else in the file"
  ],
